  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to 450F (232C).",
    "Season the bison burger patties with salt and pepper.",
    "Grill the bison burger patties for 4 minutes per side, or until cooked to desired doneness.",
    "Meanwhile, prepare the minari leaves by rinsing and patting dry with paper towels.",
    "Brush the robata grill sauce on the minari leaves and grill for 2 minutes, or until slightly charred.",
    "To assemble the dish, place a cooked bison burger patty on a plate, top with grilled minari leaves, and garnish with green onion, toasted sesame seeds, and grated daikon radish.",
    "Drizzle the coconut milk sauce over the top and serve immediately.",
    "Cook's note: For an extra crispy texture, sprinkle toasted sesame seeds on top of the dish before serving."
